  "mapping_policy": "Explicit English IPA to broad NUS ARPABET; remove stress only. Diphthongs stay one phone, specified rhotic compounds expand. Multi-phone token posterior mass divided equally; not a duration estimate. Flap dx/glottal q/velar fricative kh remain distinct without NUS counterparts. All other tokens including <unk> are unmapped phones and count in PER. Blank/boundary/BOS/EOS excluded. No label-driven mapping changes after outcomes.",
  "reference_policy": "NUS sil combines silence/inhalation; nonphone, never vocal-absence ground truth. sp is word boundary and excluded. All other reference phones retained, including unvoiced consonants. Clip intervals to frozen input; retain partially clipped final phones; no correction based on model.",
  "metrics": "Free greedy CTC PER/S/D/I, raw-mass composition vs duration reference TV, ordered-bin TV and adjacent-delta error; blank/special/unmapped mass; observation/reference/mapping coverage; all missing bins retained. Descriptive only.",
  "terms": "NUS original distribution research use only; raw files are not redistributed. Cite Duan et al., APSIPA ASC2013.",
